<title>AUSTRALIA: Burns Philp 9-month net profit tumbles.</title>
<headline>Burns Philp 9-month net profit tumbles.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended March 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  23.8 vs 48.1</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)		   1.49 vs 1.56</p>
<p>    Abnormals		   loss  2.8 vs loss 7.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Results for three months ended March 31</p>
<p>    Net			   loss  24.4 vs profit 7.1</p>
<p>    Sales				  453 vs 471</p>
<p>    Abnormals			    nil vs profit 2.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Burns Philp &amp; Co Ltd is a food ingredients group.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
